  "overview": "Pharos: JSTOR's Design System — Crisp light (hsl(0, 0%, 100%)) canvas, GT America typography, hsl(37.1, 95.5%, 56.5%) brand accent, and 8px corner geometry",
  "dos": "- **Surface & Theme Polarity**: Crisp light (hsl(0, 0%, 100%)) canvas paired with `hsl(0, 0%, 100%)` component surfaces and `#0b0b0c` primary ink.\n- **Brand & Interactive Accent**: Primary actions and focus states anchor on `hsl(37.1, 95.5%, 56.5%)` with `#0b0b0c` label contrast.\n- **Typographic Voice**: Headings and UI controls set in `GT America` across 3 type steps.\n- **Component Geometry**: Buttons (`8px`), cards (`12px`), inputs, badges, and navigation bars share consistent spacing and border contrast."
